        new(32, "Diamond", "The King Is a Poor Piece", "Replace your King with a Queen. Lose if your whole army is destroyed, if you have not won by checkmate after your 25th turn, or if the game is drawn.", "Replace your King with a Queen. Win by checkmate before your 25-turn deadline."),
        new(33, "Diamond", "Double-edged Trap", "Enemy Pawns cannot promote. A Pawn reaching its far rank permanently changes to one-square orthogonal movement and captures, while remaining a Pawn.", "Enemy Pawns lose promotion and become limited orthogonal movers on the far rank."),
        new(34, "Diamond", "Paratrooper", "After promoting, choose any empty active square to deploy that piece, if your King remains safe. Placement does not spend an extra move.", "After promotion, redeploy the promoted piece to any safe, empty active square.")
